WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.267
Work through the examples by reading, running, comparing, and then modifying the code.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:15.627
When a function is introduced, try to identify three things: the inputs, the work being done, and the output.

00:00:15.627 --> 00:00:21.782
That input-process-output mindset makes functions much easier to understand.

00:00:22.454 --> 00:00:25.686
Use the browser editor to test small changes.

00:00:25.686 --> 00:00:32.244
Change one argument, rename one variable, or adjust one return value and see what happens.
